{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07549","headline":"咏史十一首 十一 · 李华","name":"咏史十一首 十一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"沂水春可涉，泮宫映杨叶。\n丽色异人间，珊珊摇佩环。\n展禽恒独处，深巷生禾黍。\n城上飞海云，城中暗春雨。\n适来鸣佩者，复是谁家女。\n泥沾珠缀履，雨湿翠毛簪。\n电影开莲脸，雷声飞蕙心。\n自言沂水曲，采萍兼采菉。\n归迳虽可寻，天阴光景促。\n怜君贞且独，愿许君家宿。\n徒劳惜衾枕，了不顾双蛾。\n艳质诚可重，淫风如礼何。\n周王惑襃姒，城阙成陂陁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李华","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07549.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07549","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}